<!doctype html><html lang="nl"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta http-equiv="Content-Security-Policy" content="default-src 'none'; script-src 'self'; style-src 'self'; img-src 'self'; font-src 'self'; connect-src 'none'; object-src 'none'; base-uri 'none'; form-action 'none'; frame-src 'none'"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"><meta name="theme-color" content="#0c192b"><meta name="description" content="Certification & Learning Roadmap — Jeroen's Security Engineering portfolio: projects, CTFs, labs and evidence-led learning roadmap."><title>Certification & Learning Roadmap · Weijden Security</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="../assets/dashboard.css"><link rel="canonical" href="https://weijdensecurity.nl/roadmap/"><meta property="og:url" content="https://weijdensecurity.nl/roadmap/"><meta property="og:image" content="https://weijdensecurity.nl/assets/hero-globe.webp"><meta property="og:type" content="website"><meta property="og:title" content="Certification & Learning Roadmap · Weijden Security"><meta property="og:description" content="Certification & Learning Roadmap — Jeroen's Security Engineering portfolio: projects, CTFs, labs and evidence-led learning roadmap."><meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image"><link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="../assets/favicon.svg"></head><body data-page="roadmap"><a class="skip" href="#main">Naar inhoud</a><div id="header"><div class="site-header"><div class="shell topbar"><a class="brand" href="../index.html" aria-label="Weijden Security, homepage"><span class="brandmark" aria-hidden="true">W</span><span class="brand-label">Weijden Security</span><span class="brand-sub">Security Engineering Portfolio</span></a><button class="mobile-menu" type="button" aria-label="Open navigatiemenu" aria-controls="primary-nav" aria-expanded="false">Menu</button><nav class="nav" id="primary-nav" aria-label="Hoofdnavigatie"><a href="../index.html">Overview</a><a href="../projects/index.html">Projects</a><a href="../roadmap/index.html" aria-current="page">Roadmap</a><a href="../contact/index.html">Contact</a></nav><a class="profile-link" href="../contact/index.html" aria-label="Over Jeroen en contact"><img src="../assets/jeroen-portrait.webp" width="40" height="40" alt=""><span>Jeroen</span></a></div></div></div><main id="main"><div class="shell"><header class="page-header"><div class="eyebrow">Mijn ontwikkeling · 2022–2027+</div><h1>Certification &amp; Learning Roadmap</h1><p>Mijn leerroute van basiskennis naar Identity &amp; Endpoint Security Engineering. Iedere stap heeft een expliciete status en bewijsgrens.</p></header><div class="roadmap-summary"><span class="legend-item"><span class="legend-dot success"></span> Zelfgerapporteerd afgerond</span><span class="legend-item"><span class="legend-dot current"></span> Huidig doel</span><span class="legend-item"><span class="legend-dot future"></span> Gepland / voorwaardelijk</span></div><p class="intro-callout">Examendata zijn doelen totdat boeking en resultaten bevestigd zijn. AZ-104 en SC-200 zijn gerichte vaardigheden, geen automatische examendoelen. Statuscontrole: 9 november 2026.</p><div class="roadmap-tools" role="group" aria-label="Filter op type leertraject"><button type="button" class="filter" aria-pressed="true" data-track-filter="all">Alle mijlpalen</button><button type="button" class="filter" aria-pressed="false" data-track-filter="certification">Certificeringen en doelen</button><button type="button" class="filter" aria-pressed="false" data-track-filter="learning">Leertrajecten</button></div><div class="milestones"><article class="mile" id="sc900" data-track="certification"><div class="mile-dot" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="mile-box"><div class="mile-head"><span class="mile-when">4 apr 2022</span><span class="pill reported">Zelfgerapporteerd</span><span class="subline">Certificering / examendoel</span></div><h2>SC-900</h2><p>Microsoft Security, Compliance &amp; Identity Fundamentals</p><p class="note">Behaald volgens eigen rapportage; controleer bewijs vóór publieke certificeringsclaim.</p></div></article><article class="mile" id="presecurity" data-track="learning"><div class="mile-dot" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="mile-box"><div class="mile-head"><span class="mile-when">Okt 2026</span><span class="pill reported">Zelfgerapporteerd</span><span class="subline">Leerpad / vaardigheden</span></div><h2>TryHackMe Pre Security</h2><p>Fundamenteel security-leerpad</p><p class="note">Door gebruiker als afgerond gemeld; een zelfstandige kennisreview staat nog open.</p></div></article><article class="mile" id="md102" data-track="certification"><div class="mile-dot" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="mile-box"><div class="mile-head"><span class="mile-when">22 nov 2026</span><span class="pill active">In progress</span><span class="subline">Certificering / examendoel</span></div><h2>MD-102</h2><p>Endpoint Administrator — geplande herkansing</p><p class="note">Doeldatum, niet gelijk aan examenvastlegging of uitslag. Intune-lab loopt; policyconflicten vragen diagnose.</p></div></article><article class="mile" id="sec0" data-track="certification"><div class="mile-dot" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="mile-box"><div class="mile-head"><span class="mile-when">Na MD-102</span><span class="pill planned">Planned</span><span class="subline">Certificering / examendoel</span></div><h2>SEC0</h2><p>Gerichte voorbereiding op aangekocht traject</p><p class="note">Aangeschaft; geen behaald certificaat en geen bevestigde examendatum.</p></div></article><article class="mile" id="az900" data-track="certification"><div class="mile-dot" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="mile-box"><div class="mile-head"><span class="mile-when">Eind 2026 / begin 2027</span><span class="pill planned">Planned</span><span class="subline">Certificering / examendoel</span></div><h2>AZ-900</h2><p>Azure Fundamentals</p><p class="note">Voorlopig leer- en examendoel, nog niet geboekt.</p></div></article><article class="mile" id="sc300" data-track="certification"><div class="mile-dot" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="mile-box"><div class="mile-head"><span class="mile-when">Jan 2027</span><span class="pill planned">Planned</span><span class="subline">Certificering / examendoel</span></div><h2>SC-300 Academy</h2><p>Identity and Access Administrator</p><p class="note">Geplande start; 11 labactiviteiten staan op Planned, zonder vastgelegde examendatum.</p></div></article><article class="mile" id="selective" data-track="learning"><div class="mile-dot" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="mile-box"><div class="mile-head"><span class="mile-when">2027 — gefaseerd</span><span class="pill planned">Planned</span><span class="subline">Leerpad / vaardigheden</span></div><h2>Azure &amp; detection skills</h2><p>AZ-104 securitymodules, KQL en Defender (SC-200 leerstof)</p><p class="note">Geselecteerde praktijkvaardigheden, geen doel om AZ-104 of SC-200 standaard als examencertificaat te behalen.</p></div></article><article class="mile" id="sc500" data-track="certification"><div class="mile-dot" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="mile-box"><div class="mile-head"><span class="mile-when">Eind 2027 of later</span><span class="pill conditional">Voorwaardelijk</span><span class="subline">Certificering / examendoel</span></div><h2>SC-500</h2><p>Cloud &amp; AI Security Engineer — voorwaardelijke optie</p><p class="note">Alleen na een latere beoordeling van functierelevantie en geverifieerde Azure-ervaring.</p></div></article></div><div class="policy"><h2>Hoe meet ik mijn voortgang?</h2><p>Mijn Academy registreert doelen, uitgevoerde oefeningen, waarnemingen, beoordelingsresultaten en het eerstvolgende checkpoint. Er worden geen fictieve voltooiingspercentages getoond.</p><a class="text-link" href="../projects/index.html">Bekijk het praktijkwerk →</a></div></div></main><noscript><p class="shell">Alle informatie is zichtbaar. Voor zoek- en statusfilters is JavaScript nodig.</p></noscript><footer id="footer"><div class="shell footer"><span>© Jeroen · Security Engineering · Gepubliceerd portfolio · handmatig gecontroleerde voortgang</span><div><a href="../roadmap/index.html">Leerroadmap</a><span aria-hidden="true"> · </span><a href="../contact/index.html">Contact</a></div></div></footer><script defer src="../assets/dashboard.js"></script></body></html>